      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The most effective approach is one that integrates both, but the emphasis must lean toward critical thinking about systemic injustices. Focusing solely on national triumphs presents a sanitized, incomplete narrative that ignores the struggles that shaped the nation. By examining power dynamics and injustices, students learn to analyze history rather than just memorize dates, which is the true goal of education.",
